  "body": "## Summary\n\n- Updates Sepo agent infrastructure from **v0.3.1** to **v0.4.0** (df515121bbc9e9d0e066642df57ac6075b90ee8f)\n- Syncs `.agent/` source (TypeScript, docs, templates, new progress system) and all `.github/` agent workflows/actions/prompts\n- Key new capabilities in v0.4.0: progress reporting system, actor association, GitHub attachment download, env configuration, new `ask-sepo.md` issue template, `agent-add-rubrics` prompt, local-runner post-job cleanup hook\n\n## Source\n\n- **Source repo/ref:** `self-evolving/repo@v0.4.0`\n- **Source SHA:** `df515121bbc9e9d0e066642df57ac6075b90ee8f`\n- **Target branch:** `main`\n\n## Audit Summary\n\n| Path group | Status |\n|---|---|\n| `.agent/` (src, docs, templates, package.json) | ✅ Safe replace — all agent-owned |\n| `.agent/model-defaults.json` | ✅ New file added |\n| `.agent/src/actor-association.ts`, `env.ts`, `github-attachment-download.ts` | ✅ New files added |\n| `.agent/src/progress-cancel.ts`, `progress-final-comment.ts`, `progress-policy.ts`, `progress-render.ts` | ✅ New progress system files added |\n| `.agent/src/cli/download-github-attachment.ts`, `progress-report.ts`, `resolve-progress-status.ts` | ✅ New CLI files added |\n| `.agent/src/cli/progress/resolve-policy.ts` | ✅ New file added |\n| `.agent/src/__tests__/` (11 new test files) | ✅ New tests added |\n| `.agent/tools/local-runner/hooks/post-job-cleanup.sh` | ✅ New hook added |\n| `.github/actions/resolve-agent-provider/resolve-provider.js` | ✅ Safe replace — agent-owned |\n| `.github/actions/run-agent-task/action.yml` | ✅ Safe replace — agent-owned |\n| `.github/prompts/_base.md`, `_rubrics.md`, `agent-dispatch.md`, `rubrics-*.md` | ✅ Safe replace — agent-owned |\n| `.github/prompts/agent-add-rubrics.md` | ✅ New prompt added |\n| `.github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/ask-sepo.md` | ✅ New file added |\n| `.github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/install-sepo.md` | ✅ New format added (alongside existing `.yml`) |\n| `.github/workflows/*.yml` (25 files, many changed) | ✅ Safe replace — agent-owned |\n| `.github/actions/resolve-agent-provider/resolve-provider.sh` | ⚠️ Preserved (target-only legacy; unused after v0.3.1) |\n| `.github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/install-sepo.yml` | ⚠️ Preserved (target-only, old format; obsolete-file removal not requested) |\n| `.github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/agent-goal.yml` | ✅ Identical in source and target — no change needed |\n| `agent/memory` branch | ✅ Exists — no reinit needed |\n| `agent/rubrics` branch | ✅ Exists — no reinit needed |\n\n## Customizations Preserved\n\n- `.github/actions/resolve-agent-provider/resolve-provider.sh` — kept (unused after this update; safe to delete later if desired)\n- `.github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/install-sepo.yml` — kept (superseded by `install-sepo.md`; safe to delete later if desired)\n- `.github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/agent-goal.yml` — preserved as target-only file\n- All other target-only `.github/` files — untouched\n\n## Removed Files\n\nNone (obsolete-file removal was not requested for this run).\n\n## Validation Results\n\n- `npm --prefix .agent ci` — ✅ passed\n- `npm --prefix .agent run build` — ✅ passed (TypeScript compilation clean)\n- `npm --prefix .agent test` — ✅ 728/728 tests passed, 0 failed (new tests in v0.4.0 for progress system, env, actor-association, attachment download, reactions, workflow-action validation)\n- YAML syntax check for all `.github/workflows/*.yml` — ✅ all 25 files valid\n- `git diff --cached --check` (whitespace) — ✅ clean\n\n## Memory / Rubrics Branch Status\n\n- `agent/memory` — ✅ exists\n- `agent/rubrics` — ✅ exists\n\n## Post-Merge Notes\n\n1. No secrets changes required — existing auth paths are unchanged.\n2. **`AGENT_MODEL_POLICY`** (optional secret from v0.3.0, if not yet configured) — optional JSON secret for per-route model/reasoning-effort selection. Not required; defaults apply if absent.\n3. `resolve-provider.sh` and `install-sepo.yml` are now superseded and can be deleted via follow-up PR if desired.\n4. Smoke test after merge: open an issue and mention `@sepo-agent /answer` to verify the updated runtime.",
